peline.addLast(groupA, \"handlerA\", handlerA);\npipeline.addLast(groupB, \"handlerB\", handlerB);\n```\n\nMy initial code above resides in handlerB, although 'onOperationComplete' will be called from groupA's threadpool, since it does the final flush, causing the write to complete and the future to be fulfilled. This will result in a reentrant call to flush from within groupA's thread (to simplify debugging, I set groupA and groupB to have a single thread each), after the write loop has finished, but before inFlush0 is set to false.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/21830370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gsoltis","id":418301,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODMwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/418301?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis","html_url":"https://github.com/gsoltis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/21830840","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/1679#issuecomment-21830840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/1679","id":21830840,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ