ServerBootstrap set up with groups like so:\n\n``` java\nserverBootstrap.group(bossGroup, groupA);\n```\n\nSo, if I'm getting the terminology right, that makes groupA's thread the same as the Channel's thread, correct? Then handlerA above is likely unnecessary to demonstrate the issue.\n\nI will try the suggested fix and see how that goes.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/21831129/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"gsoltis","id":418301,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODMwMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/418301?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis","html_url":"https://github.com/gsoltis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsoltis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/21851133","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/1679#issuecomment-21851133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/1679","id":21851133,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIxODUxMTMz","user":{"login":"trustin","id":173918,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzkxOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173918?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gith